Package: VIGAT
Type: Package
Title: Vision-Guided Selection of Marker Gene Windows in Single-Cell ATAC Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Beijie (Paige)", "Ji", email = "beijie0210@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Renders transcription start site centered single-cell ATAC
    coverage plots for marker genes, uses a vision-capable large language
    model to select one compact genomic window per gene, and counts fragments
    in those windows to build a gene-by-cell ATAC count matrix.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/beijie02/VIGAT
BugReports: https://github.com/beijie02/VIGAT/issues
